# Runtime stack for the supported STT/render hosts (see RELEASE_GATE.md, task 1240).
# Compile one hash-locked file per supported platform ON that platform (task 1241):
#   uv pip compile requirements/runtime.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     -o requirements/runtime-<platform>-py312.txt
# Install:  python -m pip install --require-hashes -r requirements/runtime-<platform>-py312.txt
#
# STT (default single- and multi-speaker engine). WhisperX/pyannote is optional and NOT locked.
